        <mxCell id="dAuO8yrXs8Px-l155Sbv-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;glass=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Геокодинг&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nominatim&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;офіційний геокодер OpenStreetMap. Можна запустити локально через Docker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Google Maps Geocoding API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Найкраща якість пошуку, неточні адреси, скорочення, помилки. Платно після безкоштовного ліміту. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;!Лише точки!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Для полігонів &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GeoJSON&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;, готові межі районів&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-0565d43e-7fff-292e-56c0-e71f17c886cc&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/EugeneBorshch/ukraine_geojson/blob/master/UA_32_Kyivska.geojson&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;https://github.com/EugeneBorshch/ukraine_geojson/blob/master/UA_32_Kyivska.geojson&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
