        <mxCell id="dAuO8yrXs8Px-l155Sbv-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Час події&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-a0a78a3d-7fff-4119-3b4f-4c943d60c0d2&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;regex     &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(\d{1,2}:\d{2}), з (\d{1,2}:\d{2}) до (\d{1,2}:\d{2}), (\d{1,2} \w+ \d{4}) і т.д.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;dateparser  &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;бібліотека для парсингу дат&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Розуміє природну мову на багатьох мовах включно з українською. &quot;з 9 ранку до 6 вечора&quot;, &quot;вчора о 14:30&quot;, &quot;наступного понеділка&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Regex &lt;/b&gt;+ &lt;b&gt;dateparser&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;regex виокремлює часові підрядки (“з 09:00 до 18:00”), dateparser перетворює їх на об’єкти datetime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;NER   &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(CRF або BiLSTM) з додатковим тегом TIME.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot; start=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Duckling  &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;спеціалізований парсер&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
